  "description": "The Public ESPN API documentation provides a complete list of undocumented API endpoints, URL parameters, and JSON response formats across 20+ sports (NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL). Includes live curl examples, routing guides, and a Django REST API service for live scores, standings, and news. Optimized for search, developers, AI, and LLMs.",
